{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2022-11-29 14:00:00', 'title': 'GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP, A LEADING SECURITIES FRAUD LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (LDOS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "LOS ANGELES--( BUSINESS WIRE )--GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP (“GPM”), A LEADING NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LAW FIRM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (“LEIDOS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: LDOS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2022-11-29 11:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (LDOS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (“LEIDOS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NYSE: LDOS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS."}